OL,3,ARestaurant named after Xi Jinping
OL,4,Aattacked by Chinese nationals in South
OL,5,AKorea
OL,6,
OL,7,FA restaurant in South Korea named after
OL,8,FChinese leader Xi Jinping has been
OL,9,Fvandalised by a group of Chinese
OL,10,Fnationals who fled home right after the
OL,11,Fattack, police say.
OL,13,FSurveillance footage from the
OL,14,Frestaurant in Seongnam, a city south of
OL,15,FSeoul, shows four masked men storming
OL,16,Fthe premises in the early hours of 24
OL,17,FSeptember, smashing furniture and
OL,18,Fspraying lacquer.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,320,300,200,140,0,100
