OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ARestaurant named after Xi Jinping
OL,4,Aattacked by Chinese nationals in South
OL,5,AKorea
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe restaurant's owner told local media
OL,8,Fhe picked the name Xi Jinping because
OL,9,Fhe "wanted it to be the best Chinese
OL,10,Frestaurant [in South Korea]". He added
OL,11,Fthat "There was no political intent".
OL,13,FThe restaurant has been running for
OL,14,Feight years but only began getting
OL,15,Fdemands for a name change over the past
OL,16,Fyear, The Chosun Daily reported.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
